        "citation": "Roskam I, Brianda M-E, Mikolajczak M (2018). A Step Forward in the Conceptualization and Measurement of Parental Burnout: The Parental Burnout Assessment (PBA). Frontiers in Psychology 9:758. https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2018.00758. © 2018 Roskam, Brianda and Mikolajczak. Licensed CC BY 4.0.",
