        "note": "Roskam I, Brianda M-E, Mikolajczak M (2018). A Step Forward in the Conceptualization and Measurement of Parental Burnout: The Parental Burnout Assessment (PBA). Frontiers in Psychology 9:758. https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2018.00758. © 2018 Roskam, Brianda and Mikolajczak. Licensed CC BY 4.0. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ 2018 article is explicitly CC BY 4.0 and Table 1 contains the authors’ newly generated PBA23 items without separate third-party credit or exclusion. Paper Methods describes inductive generation from parent testimony and Introduction calls this a free alternative to PBI. Article footnote 1 Maslach/Jackson/Mind Garden covers PBI EE1–8 and PA1–6 comparison instrument; footnote3 covers MBI. Neither applies to PBA Table1 EX/CO/FU/ED. Do NOT reproduce the PBI/MBI comparator items. Independent Simplified Chinese working translation, platform introduction and original feedback added. Original 2018 English item wording and scoring preserved. Not author-endorsed or a validated Chinese form."
