      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "EX1",
          "content": "下面的问题关注你作为父母的感受，而不是评价孩子。请根据自己的实际体验，选择每种感受出现的频率。没有对错答案，不愿作答时可以暂停或退出。爱孩子和感到疲惫可以同时存在。\n\n作为父母，我感到自己已经完全筋疲力尽。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX2",
          "content": "我感觉自己作为父母真的已经累垮了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX3",
          "content": "做父母让我累得似乎连睡觉都不足以恢复过来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX4",
          "content": "早上起床，想到又要和孩子度过一天，我还没开始就已经觉得精疲力尽了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX5",
          "content": "只要想到要为孩子做的所有事情，我就觉得疲惫不堪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX6",
          "content": "我一点照顾孩子的精力都没有了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX7",
          "content": "做父母这件事耗尽了我所有可以调动的资源。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX8",
          "content": "有时我觉得自己像开着自动驾驶一样照顾孩子。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "EX9",
          "content": "在做父母这件事上，我正处在勉强撑下去的“生存模式”。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO1",
          "content": "我觉得对孩子来说，我已经不再是以前那个好爸爸／好妈妈了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO2",
          "content": "我告诉自己，我已经不再是以前那个做父母的自己了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO3",
          "content": "对于自己变成了现在这样的父母，我感到羞愧。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO4",
          "content": "作为父母，我不再为自己感到自豪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO5",
          "content": "和孩子相处时，我觉得自己已经不像自己了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CO6",
          "content": "我觉得自己已经失去了做爸爸／妈妈的方向。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 14,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FU1",
          "content": "我再也忍受不了自己作为爸爸／妈妈的角色了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 15,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FU2",
          "content": "做父母这件事，我再也承受不了了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 16,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FU3",
          "content": "作为父母，我觉得自己再也撑不下去了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 17,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FU4",
          "content": "作为父母，我觉得自己已经应付不过来了。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 18,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "FU5",
          "content": "和孩子在一起时，我感受不到乐趣。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 19,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ED1",
          "content": "我只做那些应该为孩子做的事，不会再做更多。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 20,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ED2",
          "content": "除了日常的例行事务（开车接送、就寝、吃饭），我已经没有能力再为孩子付出更多努力。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 21,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ED3",
          "content": "我已经没有能力向孩子表达我有多么爱他们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 22,
          "responseSetKey": "pba_frequency_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
